WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

This repository also contains material that is not mine and to which this
notice does not apply: third-party sound effects, software dependencies,
and fonts. It further contains material produced with generative AI, over
which no authorship is claimed. Both are identified in ASSETS.md. Nothing
in this notice should be read as a claim over either.


