PROVENANCE

Portions of this project's visual effects, HUD, and motion/animation work
were produced with generative AI assistance, and are identified in
ASSETS.md. Under current U.S. Copyright Office guidance, purely
AI-generated material is not eligible for copyright protection and no
claim of authorship is made over it here. The copyright claimed above
covers the original human-authored work — the code, the music, the
character art, the board, amp and stage art, the written material, and the
selection, arrangement, and integration of the project as a whole.

ASSETS.md is the authoritative record of what is original, what is
third-party, and what was AI-generated. Where this notice and ASSETS.md
appear to disagree, ASSETS.md is the more specific statement and governs.


